  "limitations": [
    "The model depicts the outdoor civilian memorial terrace at Mount Herzl. Adjacent cemetery buildings, burial plots and paths are native map features.",
    "Wall heights, the tower profile and the bronze flame reproduce the visible exterior from photographs. Dark plaques have abstract engraving at close range. Individual names and records are omitted.",
    "The court grade and path transitions use standard Terrarium elevation. Heights and paving alignment are reconstructions."
  ],
